cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this demo or its design, please cite it as below."
title: "Layout-Aware-RAG: Layout-Aware Retrieval-Augmented Generation for Engineering Datasheets"
abstract: >-
  A RAG demo for documents where the layout carries the meaning. The unit of
  retrieval is a page-native layout region -- a group of detected layout elements
  read as one unit, such as a table with its caption and footnote -- rather than a
  fixed-length token window. Document identity, page number, PDF-point bounding
  boxes, native text, section path, and a rendered evidence image travel together,
  so every result can be checked against the exact region of the exact page it came
  from. Retrieval fuses a multilingual dense index with a part-number-aware BM25
  index by Reciprocal Rank Fusion. Not quantitatively evaluated.
